<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>PeopleHub - 통합 인사(HR) 관리 시스템</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --primary: #3B82F6;
      --primary-light: #EFF6FF;
      --primary-dark: #2563EB;
      --accent-coral: #F97316;
      --accent-amber: #F59E0B;
      --bg-main: #FAFAFA;
      --bg-card: #FFFFFF;
      --text-main: #1E293B;
      --text-muted: #64748B;
      --border-color: #E2E8F0;

      /* 상태 색상 */
      --status-active-bg: #DCFCE7;
      --status-active-text: #15803D;
      --status-leave-bg: #DBEAFE;
      --status-leave-text: #1D4ED8;
      --status-pending-bg: #FEF3C7;
      --status-pending-text: #B45309;
      --status-inactive-bg: #F1F5F9;
      --status-inactive-text: #475569;

      /* 라운드 스퀘어 규격 */
      --radius-lg: 20px;
      --radius-md: 14px;
      --radius-sm: 10px;
      --shadow-sm: 0 2px 8px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04);
      --shadow-md: 0 8px 24px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.07);
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      font-family: 'Pretendard', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
    }

    body {
      background-color: var(--bg-main);
      color: var(--text-main);
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    /* 1. 상단 인사 공지 티커 (기존 stock-ticker 변형) */
    .hr-ticker {
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #1E293B, #334155);
      color: #FFFFFF;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      padding: 8px 24px;
      overflow: hidden;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
    }
    .ticker-badge {
      background-color: var(--accent-coral);
      color: white;
      font-weight: 700;
      padding: 2px 10px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .hr-ticker ul {
      list-style: none;
      display: flex;
      gap: 40px;
      animation: tickerMove 25s linear infinite;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
    @keyframes tickerMove {
      0% { transform: translateX(10%); }
      100% { transform: translateX(-100%); }
    }

    /* 2. 헤더 & 네비게이션 */
    header {
      background-color: var(--bg-card);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      padding: 16px 32px;
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 100;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    }
    .header-top {
      max-width: 1320px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 16px;
    }
    .logo-area {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
    }
    .logo-icon {
      width: 38px;
      height: 38px;
      background-color: var(--primary);
      color: white;
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }
    header h1 {
      font-size: 1.35rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--text-main);
    }
    header h1 span {
      color: var(--primary);
    }
    .search-box {
      position: relative;
      flex: 1;
      max-width: 340px;
    }
    .search-box input {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 10px 16px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      background-color: var(--bg-main);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      outline: none;
      transition: all 0.2s;
    }
    .search-box input:focus {
      border-color: var(--primary);
      background-color: #FFF;
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.15);
    }

    nav {
      max-width: 1320px;
      margin: 16px auto 0;
      display: flex;
      gap: 10px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    nav button {
      padding: 10px 20px;
      border: none;
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      background-color: transparent;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.2s;
    }
    nav button:hover {
      background-color: var(--primary-light);
      color: var(--primary);
    }
    nav button.active {
      background-color: var(--primary);
      color: #FFFFFF;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.3);
    }

    /* 3. 메인 컨테이너 & 공통 라운드 스퀘어 카드 */
    main {
      max-width: 1320px;
      margin: 28px auto;
      padding: 0 24px;
      min-height: 72vh;
    }
    .tab-section {
      display: none;
      animation: fadeIn 0.3s ease;
    }
    .tab-section.active {
      display: block;
    }
    @keyframes fadeIn {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(6px); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }

    .section-header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 12px;
    }
    .section-title {
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .card {
      background-color: var(--bg-card);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      padding: 24px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    }

    /* 상태 뱃지 스타일 */
    .badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 4px 12px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .badge-active { background: var(--status-active-bg); color: var(--status-active-text); }
    .badge-leave { background: var(--status-leave-bg); color: var(--status-leave-text); }
    .badge-pending { background: var(--status-pending-bg); color: var(--status-pending-text); }
    .badge-inactive { background: var(--status-inactive-bg); color: var(--status-inactive-text); }

    /* 버튼 스타일 */
    .btn {
      padding: 10px 18px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      border: none;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.2s;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
    }
    .btn-primary { background-color: var(--primary); color: white; }
    .btn-primary:hover { background-color: var(--primary-dark); }
    .btn-accent { background-color: var(--accent-coral); color: white; }
    .btn-accent:hover { background-color: #EA580C; }
    .btn-outline {
      background-color: white;
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      color: var(--text-main);
    }
    .btn-outline:hover { background-color: var(--bg-main); }

    /* [탭 1] 인사정보 그리드 (기존 game-list / game-card 스타일 발전) */
    .dept-filter {
      display: flex;
      gap: 8px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .dept-chip {
      padding: 6px 14px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      background: white;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    .dept-chip.active {
      background: var(--text-main);
      color: white;
      border-color: var(--text-main);
    }

    .employee-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(290px, 1fr));
      gap: 20px;
    }
    .emp-card {
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      padding: 22px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
      transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }
    .emp-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
      border-color: var(--primary);
    }
    .emp-top {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-start;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }
    .emp-profile {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 14px;
    }
    .emp-avatar {
      width: 56px;
      height: 56px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      object-fit: cover;
      background-color: var(--primary-light);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--primary);
      font-size: 1.2rem;
    }
    .emp-id {
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .emp-name {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .emp-role {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--primary);
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .emp-info-list {
      margin: 12px 0;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 6px;
    }
    .emp-award-tag {
      background: #FFFBEB;
      color: #B45309;
      border: 1px solid #FDE68A;
      padding: 6px 10px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    /* [탭 2] 부서별 업무 및 연관 네트워크 */
    .network-layout {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.6fr 1fr;
      gap: 20px;
    }
    @media (max-width: 960px) {
      .network-layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }
    .network-canvas-box {
      position: relative;
      background: #F8FAFC;
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      border: 1px dashed #CBD5E1;
      height: 440px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .isolated-alert {
      background-color: #FFF7ED;
      border: 1px solid #FDBA74;
      color: #9A3412;
      padding: 12px 16px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .manual-upload-box {
      border: 2px dashed #CBD5E1;
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      padding: 20px;
      text-align: center;
      background: var(--bg-main);
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .manual-list {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 10px;
      max-height: 240px;
      overflow-y: auto;
    }
    .manual-item {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 12px;
      background: var(--bg-main);
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      font-size: 0.86rem;
    }

    /* [탭 3] 인사평가 및 발령 안내 */
    .eval-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    @media (max-width: 860px) {
      .eval-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }
    .table-wrap {
      width: 100%;
      overflow-x: auto;
    }
    table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }
    th, td {
      padding: 12px 14px;
      text-align: left;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    }
    th {
      background-color: var(--bg-main);
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .progress-bar {
      width: 100%;
      height: 10px;
      background: #E2E8F0;
      border-radius: 999px;
      overflow: hidden;
      margin-top: 6px;
    }
    .progress-fill {
      height: 100%;
      background: var(--primary);
      border-radius: 999px;
    }

    /* [탭 4] 건의 및 문의사항 (민원 게시판 형태) */
    .voc-layout {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.4fr;
      gap: 24px;
    }
    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .voc-layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }
    .form-group {
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }
    .form-group label {
      display: block;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .form-control {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 10px 14px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      background: #FFF;
    }
    textarea.form-control {
      min-height: 110px;
      resize: vertical;
    }
    .voc-tabs {
      display: flex;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .voc-post {
      padding: 16px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      background: #FFF;
    }
    .voc-post-header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .cat-tag {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      padding: 3px 10px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    }
    .cat-suggest { background: #EFF6FF; color: #2563EB; }
    .cat-inquiry { background: #FFF7ED; color: #EA580C; }
    .cat-praise { background: #F0FDF4; color: #16A34A; }

    /* 상세 모달 (기존 video-modal 변형) */
    .hr-modal {
      display: none;
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.55);
      backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
      z-index: 999;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 20px;
    }
    .hr-modal.open {
      display: flex;
    }
    .modal-content {
      background: #FFF;
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 680px;
      max-height: 88vh;
      overflow-y: auto;
      padding: 28px;
      position: relative;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
    }
    .close-btn {
      position: absolute;
      top: 20px;
      right: 20px;
      width: 34px;
      height: 34px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      border: none;
      background: var(--bg-main);
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    .modal-subtabs {
      display: flex;
      gap: 8px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      padding-bottom: 12px;
      margin: 18px 0;
    }
    .salary-box {
      background: var(--bg-main);
      padding: 18px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      margin-top: 12px;
    }
    .salary-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 8px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--border-color);
      font-size: 0.92rem;
    }
    .salary-total {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding-top: 12px;
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      color: var(--primary);
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 28px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      margin-top: 48px;
      background: #FFF;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- 상단 인사 공지 티커 -->
  <div class="hr-ticker">
    <span class="ticker-badge">HR 안내</span>
    <ul>
      <li>[공지] 2026년 하반기 정기 인사평가 및 역량 진단 기간 안내 (11.15 ~ 11.30)</li>
      <li>[발령] 2026년 11월부 수시 조직개편 및 부서 이동 발령 결과가 공지되었습니다.</li>
      <li>[급여] 2026년 11월 급여명세서 조회가 오픈되었습니다. 인사정보 > 개인 상세에서 확인하세요.</li>
      <li>[알림] 감사실(내부감사팀)은 독립성 유지를 위해 타 부서 업무 연관 네트워크에서 분리 운영됩니다.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <!-- 헤더 영역 -->
  <header>
    <div class="header-top">
      <div class="logo-area">
        <div class="logo-icon">HR</div>
        <h1>People<span>Hub</span> 인사관리시스템</h1>
      </div>
      <div class="search-box">
        <input type="text" id="globalSearch" placeholder="임직원 성명, 사번, 부서명 검색..." onkeyup="filterEmployees()">
      </div>
      <div>
        <span class="badge badge-pending">결재 대기 2건</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav>
      <button class="active" onclick="switchTab('tab-info', this)">1. 인사정보 (개인/급여/이력)</button>
      <button onclick="switchTab('tab-network', this)">2. 부서별 업무 및 연관</button>
      <button onclick="switchTab('tab-eval', this)">3. 인사평가 및 발령 안내</button>
      <button onclick="switchTab('tab-voc', this)">4. 건의 및 문의사항</button>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <!-- ==========================================
         TAB 1: 인사정보
    =========================================== -->
    <section id="tab-info" class="tab-section active">
      <div class="section-header">
        <div>
          <h2 class="section-title">임직원 인사정보 관리</h2>
          <p style="color:var(--text-muted); font-size:0.9rem;">카드를 클릭하면 개인별 급여명세서(세전/세후) 및 부서이동 이력을 확인할 수 있습니다.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="dept-filter" id="deptFilterGroup">
          <button class="dept-chip active" onclick="setDeptFilter('전체', this)">전체 부서</button>
          <button class="dept-chip" onclick="setDeptFilter('경영지원본부', this)">경영지원본부</button>
          <button class="dept-chip" onclick="setDeptFilter('인사총무팀', this)">인사총무팀</button>
          <button class="dept-chip" onclick="setDeptFilter('연구개발본부', this)">연구개발본부</button>
          <button class="dept-chip" onclick="setDeptFilter('영업마케팅본부', this)">영업마케팅본부</button>
          <button class="dept-chip" onclick="setDeptFilter('생산품질본부', this)">생산품질본부</button>
          <button class="dept-chip" onclick="setDeptFilter('내부감사팀', this)">내부감사팀</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="employee-grid" id="employeeGrid">
        <!-- JS로 임직원 카드 렌더링 -->
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ==========================================
         TAB 2: 부서별 업무 및 연관
    =========================================== -->
    <section id="tab-network" class="tab-section">
      <div class="section-header">
        <div>
          <h2 class="section-title">부서별 업무 연관도 & 직무 매뉴얼</h2>
          <p style="color:var(--text-muted); font-size:0.9rem;">기업 조직 구조를 기반으로 부서 간 협업 연관도를 시각화하고 개인별 업무 매뉴얼을 관리합니다.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 연관 없는 부서 필수 표시 알림 -->
      <div class="isolated-alert">
        <span>⚠️ [독립 부서 표시]</span>
        <span><strong>내부감사팀 (이준호 감사역)</strong>은 직무 독립성 보장을 위해 타 부서와 업무 연관선이 연결되지 않은 <strong>연관 없음(독립) 부서</strong>입니다.</span>
      </div>

      <div class="network-layout">
        <!-- 좌측: 네트워크 다이어그램 -->
        <div class="card">
          <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; margin-bottom:12px;">
            <h3 style="font-size:1.05rem;">조직 업무 연관 네트워크 다이어그램 (기본 연관도)</h3>
            <span style="font-size:0.8rem; color:var(--text-muted);">노드를 클릭하면 담당자 업무가 표시됩니다</span>
          </div>
          <div class="network-canvas-box">
            <svg id="networkSvg" width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 700 440"></svg>
          </div>
          <div id="nodeDetailBox" style="margin-top:14px; padding:14px; background:var(--primary-light); border-radius:var(--radius-md); font-size:0.9rem;">
